      "writtenOn": "2021-09-09T11:42:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Presubmit errors are all for master-art manifest. It is a special repo manifest that uses a reduced set of projects that is needed to build ART only. It does not include framework, therefore it cannot find build target .../system/framework/arm64/boot-core-icu4j.art. The file out/soong/.intermediates/art/libartservice/service-art/android_common_apex10000/dexpreopt/oat/arm64/javalib.odex that depends on it looks strange, I don\u0027t see a module name in the path.\n\nI don\u0027t know off the top of my head where to fix it, but you should be able to reproduce if you check out a separate AOSP tree with `repo init ... -b master-art` (it is much smaller and faster than a full AOSP checkout). It is useful to have anyway as from time to time we hit master-art specific errors.",
      "revId": "6a6198d4c5a2d9bbddb9692c199a1071d95dfa9f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "34e13e78_f6d526dc",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1884045
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-11T02:51:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for explaining the error!\n\nThe file \"out/soong/.intermediates/art/libartservice/service-art/android_common_apex10000/dexpreopt/oat/arm64/javalib.odex\" is not strange, it belongs to \"service-art\", which is in the path.\n\nI was relying on \"TARGET_BUILD_APPS\" to determine whether to disable dexpreopting for APEX system server jars. It worked for `banchan`, but it didn\u0027t work for `buildbot-build.sh` because `buildbot-build.sh` does not set that variable. Therefore, the presubmit that runs `buildbot-build.sh` on `master-art` encountered the error when trying to preopt \"service-art\".\n\nInstead, I now have updated the logic to rely on \"TARGET_BUILD_UNBUNDLED\", which is set by both `banchan` and `buildbot-build.sh`.",
      "parentUuid": "2d2193e3_e44dd5be",
      "revId": "6a6198d4c5a2d9bbddb9692c199a1071d95dfa9f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
